    "On mobile, reduce item count to 4-6 or increase blur and lower opacity for readability.",
    "Respect prefers-reduced-motion: freeze loop motion and render a static low-opacity composition.",
    "This v2.0 layout replaces clustered composition with a homogeneous separated distribution. Copy only this package into public/assets/floating-meat/."
  ],
  "distribution": {
    "mode": "homogeneous-separated-two-row-field",
    "intent": "Single assets are separated across the 16:9 stage so they cover the space evenly without clustered bundles.",
    "centerPolicy": "Center remains visually breathable for Paragon section panels; objects live mostly around the frame and mid-background.",
    "assetPolicy": "Use separate OBJ assets from assets/full_atlas_centered with the shared atlas texture; do not use the combined scene OBJ for final implementation.",
